{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "8c688592-5a97-8d08-b449-db1e92ab5dd4",
  "created_at": "2026-01-12T13:25:28-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Yesenia Ortiz",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T13:22:48-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. Good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T13:22:52-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good afternoon. My name is Yesenia Ortiz. I am calling about a road problem, and also a sidewalk. I am sorry, I am on speakerphone, because I am putting on my boots by the door. [pause] Hm. One moment."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T13:23:07-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, take your time. Where's the problem at?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T13:23:11-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is at 31 Annandale Road, in the North End. It is my mother's house. I am calling for her, she is not able to walk there now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T13:23:22-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 31 Annandale. What's going on out front?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T13:23:26-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The sidewalk has heaved up, one slab is higher than the next. I tripped on it this morning. I did not fall all the way, but I caught myself on the mailbox, and my wrist is sore. [line breaks up] and the hole in the street next to it, since the storm Saturday, it is full of water."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T13:23:47-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm sorry, you broke up on me there. The hole in the street is full of water?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T13:23:54-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Full of water. You cannot see how deep. A car goes in, it will hit hard. This is not good, and honestly I am a little tired of seeing it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T13:24:06-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. And that's right at the curb in front of the house, or down the road a bit?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T13:24:13-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right in front. Maybe two meters from the driveway. The sidewalk is at the same place."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T13:24:20-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. After a storm like that the potholes pop up all over, and crews are working through a long list. I'll put 31 Annandale on the repair list for the pothole and note the sidewalk, too, so someone can look at it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T13:24:36-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please add the street to the list. That is what I want. Because I called nobody before, and I do not want somebody else to trip."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T13:24:46-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Absolutely. Can I get a callback number in case the office needs to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T13:24:52-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. It is 401-555-0158."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T13:24:54-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-five-eight. Got it. And it's Ortiz, O-R-T-I-Z?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T13:24:58-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Correct. Ortiz. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T13:25:00-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Is your wrist all right? You might want to have that looked at."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T13:25:06-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is fine, only sore. I just want the hole fixed, and the sidewalk looked at before somebody else is hurt."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T13:25:14-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I've got both noted. Watch your step out there, and if the water's covering it, keep your mother's car away from that side."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T13:25:23-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I will. Thank you. Goodbye."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T13:25:26-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Bye now."
    }
  ],
